    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Type:</strong> Third-Person Action<br><strong>Art Style:</strong> Anime, Snowy Night<br><strong>Game Overview</strong><br>This game blends rich combat experiences with lighthearted rescue missions. On a cold, snowy night, witches quietly invade Bunny Town, planning to capture all the bunnies. Your goal is simple: rescue the trapped bunnies to complete each level.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine punches and kicks freely for smooth combat and exhilarating combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can rescue bunnies while battling witches, or distract the enemies or defeat them head-on to achieve your goal. The choice is yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warm, anime-inspired art style lets you feel the healing and joy amidst intense combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat tough enemies or unleash dazzling combos to earn points. Taking damage will lower your score. Challenge yourself to beat your high score!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Type:</strong> Third-Person Action<br><strong>Art Style:</strong> Anime, Snowy Night<br><strong>Game Overview</strong><br>This game blends rich combat experiences with lighthearted rescue missions. On a cold, snowy night, witches quietly invade Bunny Town, planning to capture all the bunnies. Your goal is simple: rescue the trapped bunnies to complete each level.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine punches and kicks freely for smooth combat and exhilarating combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can rescue bunnies while battling witches, or distract the enemies or defeat them head-on to achieve your goal. The choice is yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warm, anime-inspired art style lets you feel the healing and joy amidst intense combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat tough enemies or unleash dazzling combos to earn points. Taking damage will lower your score. Challenge yourself to beat your high score!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Defeat the evil witches, rescue the trapped bunnies, and defend the peace of the town!",
